父の遺志を継ぎ、並々ならぬ努力により探索者として力をつけたノエルだが、生まれ持った才能の差を埋めることはできなかった―― しかし類稀なる才略をも開花させた彼は最強への道を見出す。\r\n仲間を集め最強の組織（クラン）を創り、そのマスターになること――。\r\n策略を巡らせ敵を翻弄し、仲間を率いて遥かなる高みを目指す。最凶の【話術士】は最強への道を切り開く。手段は選ばない。","name":"最凶の支援職【話術士】である俺は世界最強クランを従える","name_cn":"依靠最弱辅助职能【话术士】的我统领世界最强氏族","tags":[{"name":"2024年10月","count":374,"total_count":26834},{"name":"异世界","count":357,"total_count":274183},{"name":"龙傲天","count":314,"total_count":40841},{"name":"轻小说改","count":312,"total_count":509867},{"name":"TV","count":253,"total_count":1445542},{"name":"战斗","count":241,"total_count":490100},{"name":"奇幻","count":230,"total_count":492628},{"name":"2024","count":186,"total_count":73137},{"name":"FelixFilm","count":132,"total_count":2562},{"name":"厕纸","count":113,"total_count":12823},{"name":"轻改","count":107,"total_count":155947},{"name":"日本","count":102,"total_count":314707},{"name":"小说改","count":83,"total_count":167984},{"name":"疯批","count":73,"total_count":82},{"name":"画狂","count":23,"total_count":37},{"name":"冒险","count":16,"total_count":57122},{"name":"高村雄太","count":14,"total_count":38},{"name":"反套路","count":7,"total_count":1817},{"name":"智斗","count":5,"total_count":23854},{"name":"2024.10","count":5,"total_count":99},{"name":"2024年","count":5,"total_count":2740},{"name":"装逼","count":5,"total_count":9409},{"name":"TVA","count":4,"total_count":16352},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35864},{"name":"黑暗","count":3,"total_count":5021},{"name":"邪道","count":3,"total_count":327},{"name":"日本动画","count":3,"total_count":36047},{"name":"还行","count":2,"total_count":1174},{"name":"退队流","count":2,"total_count":1175},{"name":"漫改","count":2,"total_count":370246}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"依靠最弱辅助职能【话术士】的我统领世界最强氏族"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"最狂輔助職業【話術士】世界最強戰團聽我號令"},{"v":"Saikyou no Shien-shoku \"Wajutsushi\" Dearu Ore wa Sekai Saikyou Clan o Shitagaeru"},{"v":"The Most Notorious \"Talker\" Runs the World`s Greatest Clan"},{"v":"Saikyou no Shienshoku \"Wajutsushi\" de Aru Ore wa Sekai Saikyou Clan wo Shitaga